      "description": "Catalog action with descriptive stock and price; placeholders are preview labels.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-product\" aria-label=\"Add product to basket\" aria-describedby=\"ds-stock ds-price\"><span class=\"ds-image\">AB</span><span class=\"ds-info\"><span class=\"ds-name\">Product name</span><span class=\"ds-sku\">SKU</span><span id=\"ds-stock\" class=\"ds-stock\">In stock</span><span class=\"ds-bottom\"><span id=\"ds-price\">Catalog price</span><span class=\"ds-add\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg></span></span></span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-product{font-family:Tahoma,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;font-size:15px;width:220px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;text-align:start;padding:0;border:1px solid var(--line,#d6dfda);border-radius:var(--radius,12px);background:var(--surface,#fff);color:var(--ink,#172b35);overflow:hidden;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .16s ease,color .16s ease}.ds-product:hover:not(:disabled){border-color:var(--accent,#17695b);background:#fbfdfb}.ds-product:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#146c94);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-product:active:not(:disabled){filter:brightness(.96)}.ds-product:disabled{opacity:.7;cursor:not-allowed}.ds-image{height:140px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#edf1ed;font-size:2.2rem;color:#63786c}.ds-info{padding:14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px}.ds-name{font-size:.91rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.9;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-sku,.ds-stock{font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted,#546773)}.ds-stock{color:var(--accent,#17695b)}.ds-bottom{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding-top:5px;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.8;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-add{width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:6px;background:var(--subtle,#eaf0ed);display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--accent,#17695b)}.ds-add svg{width:17px;height:17px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-product{transition:none}}"
